00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:02,950
(Sheldon:)No, it's a different Leonard.

2
00:00:02,950 --> 00:00:04,200
(Leonard:)He's...

3
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:05,370
(Sheldon:)Chinese, red hair, six fingers.

4
00:00:05,370 --> 00:00:06,790
(Sheldon:)Good-bye.

5
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:11,460
(Leonard:)Raj.

6
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:13,090
(Sheldon:)Have you seen Howard?

7
00:00:13,090 --> 00:00:15,130
(Raj:)I think he's eating lunch.

8
00:00:15,130 --> 00:00:17,630
(Raj:)Uh, Sheldon, I want you
to meet Neil deGrasse Tyson

9
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,700
(Raj:)from the Hayden Planetarium
in New York.

10
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,730
(Sheldon:)I'm quite familiar
with Dr. Tyson.

11
00:00:21,740 --> 00:00:24,300
(Sheldon:)He's responsible
for the demotion of Pluto

12
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:26,110
(Sheldon:)from planetary status.

13
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:27,770
(Sheldon:)I liked Pluto.

14
00:00:28,710 --> 00:00:31,380
(Sheldon:)Ergo I do not like you.

15
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,910
(Dr Tyson:)But I actually
didn't demote Pluto.

16
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,080
(Dr Tyson:)That was a vote

17
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:35,720
(Dr Tyson:)of the International
Astronomical Union.

18
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,880
If "ifs" and "buts"
were candy and nuts,

19
00:00:37,890 --> 00:00:39,720
(Sheldon:)we'd all have a merry Christmas.

20
00:00:40,650 --> 00:00:42,940
(Sheldon:)Think about that, Dr. Tyson.

21
00:00:44,430 --> 00:00:46,760
(Dr Tyson:)Is that the guy you
were telling me about?

22
00:00:46,760 --> 00:00:49,060
(Raj:)Oh, yeah.

23
00:00:50,110 --> 00:00:52,000
(Leonard:)Howard.

24
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,570
(Sheldon:)The person at fault for you

25
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,840
(Sheldon:)not getting
a security clearance is me.

26
00:00:55,840 --> 00:00:57,570
(Howard:)You?

27
00:00:57,570 --> 00:00:59,840
